      "writtenOn": "2020-08-11T23:00:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I mentioned Blaze\u0027s behavior in an earlier comment:\n\n\u003e I also recently learned that Bazel has a feature to filter out warning output: https://docs.bazel.build/versions/master/command-line-reference.html#flag--auto_output_filter\n\u003e \n\u003e and some installations turn it on by default, e.g.:\n\u003e https://github.com/deepmind/reverb/blob/f194940368bcecd0033fa992e5b0e933e8717763/.bazelrc#L17",
      "parentUuid": "4ceb0f2f_60faaf35",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 114,
        "endChar": 7
      },
